archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-08T19:21:02Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T02:56:36Z","closed_at":"2025-11-14T02:56:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6-dev3\n- Not reproducible in 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 24.04.2 LTS\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing the new modern theme on a classic full HD, non-hidpi monitor, the icons in the menus are blurry, as well as the highlight rectangle edges. This happens on the Default and Compact spacing presets; the Spacious one seems to display the icons correctly.\n\nThe classic theme displays the icons correctly in all cases.\n\nThe blur seems on the vertical axis, as if everything was off a half-pixel vertically. Horizontally, the pixel alignment seems correct.\n\nMy guess is that the theme was developed on a Retina / Hidpi screen and not tested on non-hidpi displays.\n\nHere is the rendering of the modern theme with the three spacing settings. You can see that the round radio button icons are kinda squished vertically and the top/bottom edges of the highlight rectangle are blurry, unless in the Spacious case.\n\n<img width=\"348\" height=\"115\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54e6bb13-e1af-44f3-be75-94c110aeb134\" />\n\n<img width=\"348\" height=\"115\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99166ab2-fa18-413b-840e-ba3b70d5d38e\" />\n\n<img width=\"333\" height=\"109\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83a9384f-0fbe-4310-a3bb-48de7b1a6f53\" />\n\nDetailed view\n\nBuggy situation\n\n<img width=\"184\" height=\"184\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f9e5028-0874-40d5-a75f-3b645b5faf2c\" />\n\nGood example of non-blurry situation\n\n<img width=\"129\" height=\"126\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7782c68a-f3db-4944-b650-d39ca602e5cf\" />\n\n<img width=\"153\" height=\"246\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c5906e0-368b-429a-9a2f-f0589044a961\" />\n\nHere is how it looks on the standard setting with the classic theme\n\n<img width=\"333\" height=\"109\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d6b12ae-bc6e-4c4a-96ab-6766f4651767\" />\n\nThe blur effect is also visible on the icons and checkboxes of the top menu\n\n<img width=\"396\" height=\"83\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f6e887c-60c1-4e4d-9521-a61328c06056\" />\n\n<img width=\"220\" height=\"122\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56ccbe0f-ec00-4ff1-84d2-d752532a1fcc\" />\n\n\nAdditionally, the vertical alignment of the highlight rectangle and separators seems off in this example. I would expect to have an equivalent spacing between the separator and the highlight edges\n\n<img width=\"399\" height=\"52\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/743b3bb4-3c4a-4d07-8b5e-d20813c7ae3d\" />\n\n\n<img width=\"195\" height=\"280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51618dc4-32de-456a-baf0-591e61b47bf8\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse a non-hidpi monitor or laptop, with 1920x1080 resolution and OS scaling set at 100%.\n\nStart on a fresh project.\n\nGo to the Editor Settings and play with the spacing presets menu to see the difference.\n\nSwitch to the classic theme to see too, the issue only happens in the modern theme.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}